<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Georgia</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Georgia is a country in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/south-caucasus">South Caucasus</a> with a long Christian tradition. It had close relations with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a>, and after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nader-shah">Nader Shah</a>'s death it broke away from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afsharid-empire">Afsharid Empire</a> under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/erekle-ii">Erekle II</a>.</p></div>
